# Reference material only. None of this is part of the pack, and two of the
# three folders may not be redistributed:
#
#   Good working shader/  - Complementary License 1.8 forbids redistribution.
#   Vanilla-stock /       - Mojang's own client shader source.
#   .research/            - copies of another repository's experiment definitions.
#
# The installable pack is pack.mcmeta + assets/. See INSTALLATION.md and
# MANIFEST/licensing.md. tools/check_pack.py runs without the vanilla folder and
# does more with it; tools/manifest.py needs it.
#
# The glob has no trailing space on purpose: the local folder is literally named
# "Vanilla-stock " with one, and git ignores unescaped trailing spaces.
/Good working shader/
/Vanilla-stock*/
/.research/

# Build output from tools/package.py
/dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
